    "body": "<section id=\"shop\" class=\"tl-shop\" aria-labelledby=\"tl-shop-title\">\n<style>\n  .tl-shop { padding: var(--j2-section, 64px) 0; }\n  .tl-shop [hidden] { display: none !important; }\n  .tl-shop .tl-intro { color: var(--j2-muted); margin: 0 0 24px; max-width: 60ch; }\n  .tl-shop .tl-tabs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0; }\n  .tl-shop .tl-tab {\n    min-height: 44px; padding: 8px 16px; font: inherit; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;\n    background: transparent; color: var(--j2-primary);\n    border: 2px solid var(--j2-primary); border-radius: var(--j2-radius);\n  }\n  .tl-shop .tl-tab:hover { background: var(--j2-surface); }\n  .tl-shop .tl-tab[aria-pressed=\"true\"] { background: var(--j2-primary); color: #FFFFFF; }\n  /* W-9: Clear filters buttons match the category tabs (body font, same corner radius) */\n  .tl-shop .tl-reset { font: inherit; font-weight: 700; border-radius: var(--j2-radius); }\n  .tl-shop .tl-filters {\n    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; align-items: end;\n    background: var(--j2-surface); border-radius: var(--j2-radius); padding: 16px; margin: 0 0 16px;\n  }\n  .tl-shop .tl-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; min-width: 0; }\n  .tl-shop .tl-field label { font-weight: 700; font-size: .9rem; color: var(--j2-text); }\n  .tl-shop .tl-field select {\n    width: 100%; min-height: 44px; padding: 8px 12px; font: inherit; font-size: 16px;\n    color: var(--j2-text); background: #FFFFFF;\n    border: 2px solid var(--j2-primary); border-radius: var(--j2-radius);\n  }\n  .tl-shop .tl-status { margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--j2-muted); font-weight: 600; }\n  .tl-shop .tl-grid {\n    display: grid; gap: 16px; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(240px, 100%), 1fr));\n  }\n  .tl-shop .tl-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; }\n  .tl-shop .tl-ph {\n    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center;\n    padding: 12px; background: var(--j2-surface); color: var(--j2-muted);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #E3D6C0; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  .tl-shop .tl-card-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; padding: 16px; flex: 1; }\n  .tl-shop .tl-cat { margin: 0; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--j2-secondary); }\n  .tl-shop .tl-card h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.35rem; }\n  .tl-shop .tl-sizes { margin: 0; color: var(--j2-muted); font-size: .95rem; }\n  .tl-shop .tl-price { margin: 4px 0 12px; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--j2-primary); }\n  .tl-shop .tl-card .j2-btn { margin-top: auto; width: 100%; text-align: center; }\n  .tl-shop .tl-empty { text-align: center; padding: 32px 16px; background: var(--j2-surface); border-radius: var(--j2-radius); }\n  .tl-shop .tl-empty p { margin: 0 0 16px; }\n  @media (min-width: 560px) {\n    .tl-shop .tl-filters { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr auto; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"j2-container\">\n  <h2 id=\"tl-shop-title\">Shop</h2>\n  <p class=\"tl-intro\">Handloom kurtas, sarees, cotton shirts and dupattas. Pick a category, then narrow by size and price. Product photos are placeholders until real photos arrive.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"tl-tabs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Browse by category\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"tl-tab\" data-cat=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All (10)</button>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"tl-tab\" data-cat=\"kurtas\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Kurtas (3)</button>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"tl-tab\" data-cat=\"sarees\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Sarees (3)</button>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"tl-tab\" data-cat=\"shirts\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Cotton shirts (2)</button>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"tl-tab\" data-cat=\"dupattas\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Dupattas (2)</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"tl-filters\">\n    <div class=\"tl-field\">\n      <label for=\"tl-size\">Size</label>\n      <select id=\"tl-size\">\n        <option value=\"all\">All sizes</option>\n        <option value=\"XS\">XS</option>\n        <option value=\"S\">S</option>\n        <option value=\"M\">M</option>\n        <option value=\"L\">L</option>\n        <option value=\"XL\">XL</option>\n        <option value=\"XXL\">XXL</option>\n        <option value=\"FREE\">Free size</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tl-field\">\n      <label for=\"tl-price\">Price</label>\n      <select id=\"tl-price\">\n        <option value=\"all\">Any price</option>\n        <option value=\"0-1499\">Under ₹1,500</option>\n        <option value=\"1500-2999\">₹1,500 to ₹2,999</option>\n        <option value=\"3000-999999\">₹3,000 and above</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"j2-btn-secondary tl-reset\">Clear filters</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"tl-status\" id=\"tl-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Showing 10 of 10 products</p>\n\n  <div class=\"tl-grid\" id=\"tl-grid\">\n    <article class=\"j2-card tl-card\" data-cat=\"kurtas\" data-name=\"Indigo block-print kurta\" data-price=\"1499\" data-price-text=\"1,499\" data-sizes=\"S M L XL XXL\">\n      <div class=\"tl-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for Indigo block-print kurta\">Placeholder image<br>Photo coming soon</div>\n      <div class=\"tl-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-cat\">Kurtas</p>\n        <h3>Indigo block-print kurta</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-sizes\">Sizes: S to XXL</p>\n        <p class=\"tl-price\">₹1,499</p>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn tl-order\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order Indigo block-print kurta on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20Indigo%20block-print%20kurta%20(Rs%201%2C499).\">Order on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"j2-card tl-card\" data-cat=\"kurtas\" data-name=\"Mustard handloom kurta\" data-price=\"1699\" data-price-text=\"1,699\" data-sizes=\"S M L XL\">\n      <div class=\"tl-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for Mustard handloom kurta\">Placeholder image<br>Photo coming soon</div>\n      <div class=\"tl-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-cat\">Kurtas</p>\n        <h3>Mustard handloom kurta</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-sizes\">Sizes: S to XL</p>\n        <p class=\"tl-price\">₹1,699</p>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn tl-order\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order Mustard handloom kurta on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20Mustard%20handloom%20kurta%20(Rs%201%2C699).\">Order on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"j2-card tl-card\" data-cat=\"kurtas\" data-name=\"White chikankari kurta\" data-price=\"2199\" data-price-text=\"2,199\" data-sizes=\"XS S M L XL\">\n      <div class=\"tl-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for White chikankari kurta\">Placeholder image<br>Photo coming soon</div>\n      <div class=\"tl-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-cat\">Kurtas</p>\n        <h3>White chikankari kurta</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-sizes\">Sizes: XS to XL</p>\n        <p class=\"tl-price\">₹2,199</p>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn tl-order\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order White chikankari kurta on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20White%20chikankari%20kurta%20(Rs%202%2C199).\">Order on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"j2-card tl-card\" data-cat=\"sarees\" data-name=\"Ikat handloom saree\" data-price=\"3499\" data-price-text=\"3,499\" data-sizes=\"FREE\">\n      <div class=\"tl-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for Ikat handloom saree\">Placeholder image<br>Photo coming soon</div>\n      <div class=\"tl-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-cat\">Sarees</p>\n        <h3>Ikat handloom saree</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-sizes\">Free size</p>\n        <p class=\"tl-price\">₹3,499</p>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn tl-order\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order Ikat handloom saree on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20Ikat%20handloom%20saree%20(Rs%203%2C499).\">Order on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"j2-card tl-card\" data-cat=\"sarees\" data-name=\"Khadi silk saree\" data-price=\"4999\" data-price-text=\"4,999\" data-sizes=\"FREE\">\n      <div class=\"tl-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for Khadi silk saree\">Placeholder image<br>Photo coming soon</div>\n      <div class=\"tl-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-cat\">Sarees</p>\n        <h3>Khadi silk saree</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-sizes\">Free size</p>\n        <p class=\"tl-price\">₹4,999</p>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn tl-order\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order Khadi silk saree on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20Khadi%20silk%20saree%20(Rs%204%2C999).\">Order on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"j2-card tl-card\" data-cat=\"sarees\" data-name=\"Cotton jamdani saree\" data-price=\"3999\" data-price-text=\"3,999\" data-sizes=\"FREE\">\n      <div class=\"tl-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for Cotton jamdani saree\">Placeholder image<br>Photo coming soon</div>\n      <div class=\"tl-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-cat\">Sarees</p>\n        <h3>Cotton jamdani saree</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-sizes\">Free size</p>\n        <p class=\"tl-price\">₹3,999</p>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn tl-order\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order Cotton jamdani saree on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20Cotton%20jamdani%20saree%20(Rs%203%2C999).\">Order on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"j2-card tl-card\" data-cat=\"shirts\" data-name=\"Khadi cotton shirt\" data-price=\"1299\" data-price-text=\"1,299\" data-sizes=\"S M L XL XXL\">\n      <div class=\"tl-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for Khadi cotton shirt\">Placeholder image<br>Photo coming soon</div>\n      <div class=\"tl-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-cat\">Cotton shirts</p>\n        <h3>Khadi cotton shirt</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-sizes\">Sizes: S to XXL</p>\n        <p class=\"tl-price\">₹1,299</p>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn tl-order\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order Khadi cotton shirt on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20Khadi%20cotton%20shirt%20(Rs%201%2C299).\">Order on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"j2-card tl-card\" data-cat=\"shirts\" data-name=\"Linen-blend shirt\" data-price=\"1599\" data-price-text=\"1,599\" data-sizes=\"M L XL XXL\">\n      <div class=\"tl-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for Linen-blend shirt\">Placeholder image<br>Photo coming soon</div>\n      <div class=\"tl-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-cat\">Cotton shirts</p>\n        <h3>Linen-blend shirt</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-sizes\">Sizes: M to XXL</p>\n        <p class=\"tl-price\">₹1,599</p>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn tl-order\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order Linen-blend shirt on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20Linen-blend%20shirt%20(Rs%201%2C599).\">Order on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"j2-card tl-card\" data-cat=\"dupattas\" data-name=\"Block-print dupatta\" data-price=\"899\" data-price-text=\"899\" data-sizes=\"FREE\">\n      <div class=\"tl-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for Block-print dupatta\">Placeholder image<br>Photo coming soon</div>\n      <div class=\"tl-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-cat\">Dupattas</p>\n        <h3>Block-print dupatta</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-sizes\">Free size</p>\n        <p class=\"tl-price\">₹899</p>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn tl-order\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order Block-print dupatta on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20Block-print%20dupatta%20(Rs%20899).\">Order on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"j2-card tl-card\" data-cat=\"dupattas\" data-name=\"Chanderi dupatta\" data-price=\"1099\" data-price-text=\"1,099\" data-sizes=\"FREE\">\n      <div class=\"tl-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for Chanderi dupatta\">Placeholder image<br>Photo coming soon</div>\n      <div class=\"tl-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-cat\">Dupattas</p>\n        <h3>Chanderi dupatta</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-sizes\">Free size</p>\n        <p class=\"tl-price\">₹1,099</p>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn tl-order\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order Chanderi dupatta on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20Chanderi%20dupatta%20(Rs%201%2C099).\">Order on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"tl-empty\" id=\"tl-empty\" hidden>\n    <p>No products match these filters.</p>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"j2-btn tl-reset\">Clear filters</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  try {\n    var root = document.getElementById('shop');\n    if (!root) return;\n    var cards = root.querySelectorAll('.tl-card');\n    var tabs = root.querySelectorAll('.tl-tab');\n    var sizeSel = document.getElementById('tl-size');\n    var priceSel = document.getElementById('tl-price');\n    var status = document.getElementById('tl-status');\n    var empty = document.getElementById('tl-empty');\n    var resets = root.querySelectorAll('.tl-reset');\n    var cat = 'all';\n\n    function orderHref(card, size) {\n      var msg = 'Hi Thread & Loom, I would like to order: ' + card.getAttribute('data-name') +\n        ' (Rs ' + card.getAttribute('data-price-text') + ')' +\n        (size && size !== 'all' && size !== 'FREE' ? ', size ' + size : '') + '.';\n      return 'https://wa.me/910000011111?text=' + encodeURIComponent(msg);\n    }\n\n    function apply() {\n      var size = sizeSel.value;\n      var range = priceSel.value;\n      var min = 0, max = Infinity;\n      if (range !== 'all') {\n        var parts = range.split('-');\n        min = parseInt(parts[0], 10);\n        max = parseInt(parts[1], 10);\n      }\n      var shown = 0;\n      for (var i = 0; i < cards.length; i++) {\n        var c = cards[i];\n        var price = parseInt(c.getAttribute('data-price'), 10);\n        var sizes = c.getAttribute('data-sizes').split(' ');\n        var ok = (cat === 'all' || c.getAttribute('data-cat') === cat) &&\n                 (size === 'all' || sizes.indexOf(size) !== -1) &&\n                 (price >= min && price <= max);\n        c.hidden = !ok;\n        if (ok) shown++;\n        var link = c.querySelector('.tl-order');\n        if (link) link.setAttribute('href', orderHref(c, size));\n      }\n      status.textContent = 'Showing ' + shown + ' of ' + cards.length + ' products';\n      empty.hidden = shown !== 0;\n    }\n\n    for (var t = 0; t < tabs.length; t++) {\n      tabs[t].addEventListener('click', function () {\n        cat = this.getAttribute('data-cat');\n        for (var k = 0; k < tabs.length; k++) {\n          tabs[k].setAttribute('aria-pressed', tabs[k] === this ? 'true' : 'false');\n        }\n        apply();\n      });\n    }\n    sizeSel.addEventListener('change', apply);\n    priceSel.addEventListener('change', apply);\n    for (var r = 0; r < resets.length; r++) {\n      resets[r].addEventListener('click', function () {\n        cat = 'all';\n        sizeSel.value = 'all';\n        priceSel.value = 'all';\n        for (var k = 0; k < tabs.length; k++) {\n          tabs[k].setAttribute('aria-pressed', tabs[k].getAttribute('data-cat') === 'all' ? 'true' : 'false');\n        }\n        apply();\n      });\n    }\n    apply();\n  } catch (err) { /* cards are plain HTML, so the catalogue stays readable without filters */ }\n})();\n</script>\n</section>",
    "workflow": "Style Clear filters button"
  },
  "W-2": {
    "owner": "W-8",
    "head": "<style>\n  /* W-8: the hero (W-2) must lead the page even though its section is written after the shop (W-3) */\n  body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  body > * { order: 3; }\n  body > .tl-header { order: 0; }\n  body > #tl-hero-wrap { order: 1; }\n  body > #shop { order: 2; }\n</style>",
    "body": "<style>\n  .tl-w2 [hidden] { display: none !important; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-hero {\n    background: var(--j2-surface);\n    padding: calc(var(--j2-section, 64px) * .75) 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #E3D6C0;\n  }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-eyebrow {\n    margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--j2-secondary);\n  }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-hero h1 { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--j2-primary); }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-lead { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.15rem; max-width: 52ch; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-place { margin: 0 0 24px; color: var(--j2-muted); font-weight: 600; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-actions .j2-btn,\n  .tl-w2 .tl-actions .j2-btn-secondary { flex: 1 1 200px; text-align: center; border-radius: var(--j2-radius); }\n\n  .tl-w2 .tl-visit { padding: var(--j2-section, 64px) 0; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-visit .tl-intro { color: var(--j2-muted); margin: 0 0 24px; max-width: 60ch; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-visit-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-panel { padding: 24px 16px; min-width: 0; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-panel h3 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--j2-primary); }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-address { font-style: normal; margin: 0 0 16px; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-address strong { display: block; font-size: 1.1rem; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-contact-list { list-style: none; margin: 16px 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 12px; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-contact-list li { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-label { font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--j2-muted); }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-contact-list .j2-btn,\n  .tl-w2 .tl-contact-list .j2-btn-secondary,\n  .tl-w2 .tl-panel > .j2-btn-secondary { width: 100%; text-align: center; border-radius: var(--j2-radius); }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-hours { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0 0 16px; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-hours th, .tl-w2 .tl-hours td {\n    text-align: left; padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E3D6C0; vertical-align: top;\n  }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-hours th { font-weight: 700; color: var(--j2-text); width: 45%; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-hours tr:last-child th, .tl-w2 .tl-hours tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-closed td { color: var(--j2-muted); font-weight: 700; }\n  .tl-w2 .tl-hours-note { margin: 0; color: var(--j2-muted); font-size: .95rem; }\n  @media (min-width: 760px) {\n    .tl-w2 .tl-visit-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; }\n    .tl-w2 .tl-panel { padding: 32px 24px; }\n    .tl-w2 .tl-actions .j2-btn,\n    .tl-w2 .tl-actions .j2-btn-secondary { flex: 0 0 auto; }\n    .tl-w2 .tl-contact-list li { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\n    .tl-w2 .tl-contact-list .tl-label { flex: 0 0 120px; }\n    .tl-w2 .tl-contact-list .j2-btn,\n    .tl-w2 .tl-contact-list .j2-btn-secondary { width: auto; flex: 1 1 auto; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"tl-w2\" id=\"tl-hero-wrap\">\n  <section class=\"tl-hero\" id=\"welcome\" aria-labelledby=\"tl-hero-title\">\n    <div class=\"j2-container\">\n      <p class=\"tl-eyebrow\">Handloom boutique, Pune</p>\n      <h1 id=\"tl-hero-title\">Thread &amp; Loom</h1>\n      <p class=\"tl-lead\">Handloom kurtas, sarees, cotton shirts and dupattas.</p>\n      <p class=\"tl-place\">18 FC Road, Shivajinagar, Pune</p>\n      <div class=\"tl-actions\">\n        <a class=\"j2-btn\" href=\"#shop\">Browse the collection</a>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn-secondary\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20place%20an%20order.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Order on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tl-w2\">\n  <section class=\"tl-visit\" id=\"visit\" aria-labelledby=\"tl-visit-title\">\n    <div class=\"j2-container\">\n      <h2 id=\"tl-visit-title\">Visit Us</h2>\n      <p class=\"tl-intro\">Drop in at the shop, call us, or send an order on WhatsApp.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"tl-visit-grid\">\n        <div class=\"j2-card tl-panel\">\n          <h3>Find us</h3>\n          <address class=\"tl-address\">\n            <strong>Thread &amp; Loom</strong>\n            18 FC Road, Shivajinagar,<br>Pune 411005\n          </address>\n          <a class=\"j2-btn-secondary\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=18+FC+Road+Shivajinagar+Pune+411005\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get directions</a>\n\n          <ul class=\"tl-contact-list\">\n            <li>\n              <span class=\"tl-label\">WhatsApp orders</span>\n              <a class=\"j2-btn\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20place%20an%20order.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order on WhatsApp at +91 00000 11111\">+91 00000 11111</a>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <span class=\"tl-label\">Shop phone</span>\n              <a class=\"j2-btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+910000022222\" aria-label=\"Call the shop on +91 00000 22222\">+91 00000 22222</a>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"j2-card tl-panel\">\n          <h3>Store timings</h3>\n          <table class=\"tl-hours\">\n            <caption class=\"tl-label\" style=\"text-align:left;padding:0 8px 8px;caption-side:top;\">Open Tuesday to Sunday</caption>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr><th scope=\"row\">Tuesday to Sunday</th><td>11am to 9pm</td></tr>\n              <tr class=\"tl-closed\"><th scope=\"row\">Monday</th><td>Closed</td></tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n          <p class=\"tl-hours-note\">11am to 9pm, Tuesday to Sunday. Closed on Monday.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  try {\n    var hero = document.getElementById('tl-hero-wrap');\n    var shop = document.getElementById('shop');\n    if (hero && shop && shop.parentNode &&\n        (shop.compareDocumentPosition(hero) & Node.DOCUMENT_POSITION_FOLLOWING)) {\n      shop.parentNode.insertBefore(hero, shop);\n    }\n  } catch (err) { /* the CSS order rule in the head still puts the hero first */ }\n})();\n</script>",
    "workflow": "Move hero ahead of shop"
  },
  "W-4": {
    "owner": "W-4",
    "head": "",
    "body": "<section id=\"size-guide\" class=\"tl-sizeguide\" aria-labelledby=\"tl-sizeguide-title\">\n<style>\n  .tl-sizeguide { padding: var(--j2-section, 64px) 0; }\n  .tl-sizeguide .tl-intro { color: var(--j2-muted); margin: 0 0 24px; max-width: 60ch; }\n  .tl-sizeguide .tl-sg-card { max-width: 560px; padding: 8px 16px 16px; }\n  .tl-sizeguide .tl-sg-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; }\n  .tl-sizeguide .tl-sg-table caption {\n    text-align: left; padding: 16px 8px 8px; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--j2-muted);\n  }\n  .tl-sizeguide .tl-sg-table th,\n  .tl-sizeguide .tl-sg-table td {\n    text-align: left; padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E3D6C0; vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  .tl-sizeguide .tl-sg-table thead th {\n    background: var(--j2-surface); color: var(--j2-primary); font-weight: 700;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--j2-primary);\n  }\n  .tl-sizeguide .tl-sg-table tbody th { font-weight: 700; color: var(--j2-text); width: 50%; }\n  .tl-sizeguide .tl-sg-table tbody td { font-weight: 600; color: var(--j2-text); }\n  .tl-sizeguide .tl-sg-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) th,\n  .tl-sizeguide .tl-sg-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: var(--j2-background); }\n  .tl-sizeguide .tl-sg-table tbody tr:last-child th,\n  .tl-sizeguide .tl-sg-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }\n  .tl-sizeguide .tl-sg-note { margin: 16px 0 0; color: var(--j2-muted); font-size: .95rem; }\n  .tl-sizeguide .tl-sg-cta { margin-top: 16px; border-radius: var(--j2-radius); }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"j2-container\">\n  <h2 id=\"tl-sizeguide-title\">Size Guide</h2>\n  <p class=\"tl-intro\">Find your size by chest measurement, in inches.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"j2-card tl-sg-card\">\n    <table class=\"tl-sg-table\">\n      <caption>Chest size by garment size</caption>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Size</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Chest (inches)</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><th scope=\"row\">XS</th><td>32</td></tr>\n        <tr><th scope=\"row\">S</th><td>34</td></tr>\n        <tr><th scope=\"row\">M</th><td>36</td></tr>\n        <tr><th scope=\"row\">L</th><td>38</td></tr>\n        <tr><th scope=\"row\">XL</th><td>40</td></tr>\n        <tr><th scope=\"row\">XXL</th><td>42</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <p class=\"tl-sg-note\">Sarees and dupattas are free size.</p>\n    <a class=\"j2-btn-secondary tl-sg-cta\" href=\"#shop\">Shop by size</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "workflow": "Size guide"
  },
  "W-5": {
    "owner": "W-5",
    "head": "",
    "body": "<section id=\"new-arrivals\" class=\"tl-arrivals\" aria-labelledby=\"tl-arrivals-title\">\n<style>\n  .tl-arrivals { padding: var(--j2-section, 64px) 0; background: var(--j2-surface); }\n  .tl-arrivals .tl-intro { color: var(--j2-muted); margin: 0 0 24px; max-width: 60ch; }\n  .tl-arrivals .tl-na-grid {\n    display: grid; gap: 16px; list-style: none; margin: 0 0 24px; padding: 0;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(240px, 100%), 1fr));\n  }\n  .tl-arrivals .tl-na-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; }\n  .tl-arrivals .tl-na-ph {\n    position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center; padding: 12px; background: var(--j2-background); color: var(--j2-muted);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #E3D6C0; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  .tl-arrivals .tl-na-tag {\n    position: absolute; top: 12px; left: 12px; padding: 4px 10px;\n    background: var(--j2-secondary); color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: var(--j2-radius);\n    font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .tl-arrivals .tl-na-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; padding: 16px; flex: 1; }\n  .tl-arrivals .tl-na-cat { margin: 0; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--j2-secondary); }\n  .tl-arrivals .tl-na-item h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.35rem; }\n  .tl-arrivals .tl-na-sizes { margin: 0; color: var(--j2-muted); font-size: .95rem; }\n  .tl-arrivals .tl-na-price { margin: 4px 0 12px; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--j2-primary); }\n  .tl-arrivals .tl-na-item .j2-btn { margin-top: auto; width: 100%; text-align: center; border-radius: var(--j2-radius); }\n  .tl-arrivals .tl-na-more { border-radius: var(--j2-radius); }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"j2-container\">\n  <h2 id=\"tl-arrivals-title\">New Arrivals</h2>\n  <p class=\"tl-intro\">The newest pieces at Thread &amp; Loom. Product photos are placeholders until real photos arrive.</p>\n\n  <ul class=\"tl-na-grid\">\n    <li class=\"j2-card tl-na-item\">\n      <div class=\"tl-na-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for White chikankari kurta\">\n        <span class=\"tl-na-tag\">New</span>\n        <span>Placeholder image<br>Photo coming soon</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-na-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-na-cat\">Kurtas</p>\n        <h3>White chikankari kurta</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-na-sizes\">Sizes: XS to XL</p>\n        <p class=\"tl-na-price\">₹2,199</p>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order White chikankari kurta on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20White%20chikankari%20kurta%20(Rs%202%2C199).\">Order on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n\n    <li class=\"j2-card tl-na-item\">\n      <div class=\"tl-na-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for Ikat handloom saree\">\n        <span class=\"tl-na-tag\">New</span>\n        <span>Placeholder image<br>Photo coming soon</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-na-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-na-cat\">Sarees</p>\n        <h3>Ikat handloom saree</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-na-sizes\">Free size</p>\n        <p class=\"tl-na-price\">₹3,499</p>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order Ikat handloom saree on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20Ikat%20handloom%20saree%20(Rs%203%2C499).\">Order on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n\n    <li class=\"j2-card tl-na-item\">\n      <div class=\"tl-na-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for Linen-blend shirt\">\n        <span class=\"tl-na-tag\">New</span>\n        <span>Placeholder image<br>Photo coming soon</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-na-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-na-cat\">Cotton shirts</p>\n        <h3>Linen-blend shirt</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-na-sizes\">Sizes: M to XXL</p>\n        <p class=\"tl-na-price\">₹1,599</p>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order Linen-blend shirt on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20Linen-blend%20shirt%20(Rs%201%2C599).\">Order on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <a class=\"j2-btn-secondary tl-na-more\" href=\"#shop\">See all products</a>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "workflow": "New arrivals"
  },
  "W-6": {
