    "body": "<section id=\"lookbook\" class=\"tl-lookbook\" aria-labelledby=\"tl-lookbook-title\">\n<style>\n  .tl-lookbook { padding: var(--j2-section, 64px) 0; }\n  .tl-lookbook .tl-intro { color: var(--j2-muted); margin: 0 0 24px; max-width: 60ch; }\n  .tl-lookbook .tl-lb-grid {\n    display: grid; gap: 16px; list-style: none; margin: 0 0 24px; padding: 0;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(280px, 100%), 1fr));\n  }\n  .tl-lookbook .tl-lb-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; }\n  .tl-lookbook .tl-lb-ph {\n    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center;\n    padding: 12px; background: var(--j2-surface); color: var(--j2-muted);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #E3D6C0; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  .tl-lookbook .tl-lb-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 16px; flex: 1; }\n  .tl-lookbook .tl-lb-num { margin: 0; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--j2-secondary); }\n  .tl-lookbook .tl-lb-item h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--j2-primary); }\n  .tl-lookbook .tl-lb-note { margin: 0; color: var(--j2-muted); }\n  .tl-lookbook .tl-lb-pieces { list-style: none; margin: 4px 0 8px; padding: 0; }\n  .tl-lookbook .tl-lb-pieces li {\n    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px;\n    padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #E3D6C0;\n  }\n  .tl-lookbook .tl-lb-pieces li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n  .tl-lookbook .tl-lb-piece { font-weight: 600; min-width: 0; }\n  .tl-lookbook .tl-lb-price { font-weight: 700; color: var(--j2-primary); white-space: nowrap; }\n  .tl-lookbook .tl-lb-item .j2-btn { margin-top: auto; width: 100%; text-align: center; border-radius: var(--j2-radius); }\n  .tl-lookbook .tl-lb-more { border-radius: var(--j2-radius); }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"j2-container\">\n  <h2 id=\"tl-lookbook-title\">Lookbook</h2>\n  <p class=\"tl-intro\">Three outfits styled from the Thread &amp; Loom collection. Outfit images are placeholders until real photos arrive.</p>\n\n  <ul class=\"tl-lb-grid\">\n    <li class=\"j2-card tl-lb-item\">\n      <div class=\"tl-lb-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for Outfit 1: Mustard handloom kurta with Chanderi dupatta\">Placeholder image<br>Outfit photo coming soon</div>\n      <div class=\"tl-lb-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-lb-num\">Outfit 1</p>\n        <h3>Kurta and dupatta</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-lb-note\">The Mustard handloom kurta paired with the Chanderi dupatta.</p>\n        <ul class=\"tl-lb-pieces\">\n          <li><span class=\"tl-lb-piece\">Mustard handloom kurta</span><span class=\"tl-lb-price\">₹1,699</span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"tl-lb-piece\">Chanderi dupatta</span><span class=\"tl-lb-price\">₹1,099</span></li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order Outfit 1, Mustard handloom kurta and Chanderi dupatta, on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20Mustard%20handloom%20kurta%20(Rs%201%2C699)%20and%20Chanderi%20dupatta%20(Rs%201%2C099).\">Order this look on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n\n    <li class=\"j2-card tl-lb-item\">\n      <div class=\"tl-lb-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for Outfit 2: Khadi silk saree\">Placeholder image<br>Outfit photo coming soon</div>\n      <div class=\"tl-lb-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-lb-num\">Outfit 2</p>\n        <h3>The saree look</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-lb-note\">The Khadi silk saree, worn as a single statement piece.</p>\n        <ul class=\"tl-lb-pieces\">\n          <li><span class=\"tl-lb-piece\">Khadi silk saree</span><span class=\"tl-lb-price\">₹4,999</span></li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order Outfit 2, Khadi silk saree, on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20Khadi%20silk%20saree%20(Rs%204%2C999).\">Order this look on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n\n    <li class=\"j2-card tl-lb-item\">\n      <div class=\"tl-lb-ph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder image for Outfit 3: Indigo block-print kurta with Block-print dupatta\">Placeholder image<br>Outfit photo coming soon</div>\n      <div class=\"tl-lb-body\">\n        <p class=\"tl-lb-num\">Outfit 3</p>\n        <h3>Block-print pair</h3>\n        <p class=\"tl-lb-note\">The Indigo block-print kurta matched with the Block-print dupatta.</p>\n        <ul class=\"tl-lb-pieces\">\n          <li><span class=\"tl-lb-piece\">Indigo block-print kurta</span><span class=\"tl-lb-price\">₹1,499</span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"tl-lb-piece\">Block-print dupatta</span><span class=\"tl-lb-price\">₹899</span></li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"j2-btn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Order Outfit 3, Indigo block-print kurta and Block-print dupatta, on WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/910000011111?text=Hi%20Thread%20%26%20Loom%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20order%3A%20Indigo%20block-print%20kurta%20(Rs%201%2C499)%20and%20Block-print%20dupatta%20(Rs%20899).\">Order this look on WhatsApp</a>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <a class=\"j2-btn-secondary tl-lb-more\" href=\"#shop\">Shop all products</a>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "workflow": "Lookbook"
  },
